  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSFORM Phase 1 CORE spend: scaling early-stage business models in Africa and Asia with support from Unilever and EY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity TRANSFORM Phase 1 CORE spend: scaling early-stage business models in Africa and Asia with support from Unilever and EY is a component of TRANSFORM - Transformative Market Based Models for low income household needs reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;2,458,437. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Technological research and development, Medical research, Research/scientific institutions, Agricultural research, Energy research, Environmental research.</narrative>
  </description>
